# New single characters needed (not yet GLOSS keys), with readings:
#   僕 pú (to drive a carriage; Zhu Xi 御車也; a servant), 合 hé (to gather, come together; Zhu Xi 聚也),
#   圃 pǔ (a vegetable plot, growing greens; Zhu Xi 種蔬菜曰圃; a gardener in 老圃), 完 wán (complete, fully
#   provided; Zhu Xi 備也), 專 zhuān (singly, on one's own; Zhu Xi and He Yan 獨也), 従 cóng (the edition's form
#   of 從: to follow, obey; 従政 to take part in government), 情 qíng (true feeling, the real state; Zhu Xi 誠實也,
#   Kong Anguo 情實), 措 cuò (to place, to set), 教 jiào (to teach), 殘 cán (cruel, violent; the cruel; Zhu Xi
