#   公子荆), 葢 gài (the edition's form of 蓋: as a rule, surely), 襁 qiǎng (a sling for carrying a baby on the
#   back; Zhu Xi 居丈反, 織縷為之以約小兒於背者), 赦 shè (to pardon), 農 nóng (a farmer), 迂 yū (roundabout,
#   far from the point; Zhu Xi 逺於事情), 須 xū (Xu, in 樊須).
# Existing entries that need broadening (for the glosser): 庶 ('numerous, many', Zhu Xi 庶衆也, 13.9);
#   晏 ('late', Zhu Xi 晏晚也, 13.14); 以 ('to use, to employ', Zhu Xi 以用也, 13.14 不吾以; also 13.5 奚以為);
#   苟 ('roughly, more or less', Zhu Xi 聊且粗畧之意, 13.8); 名 (verb 'to name', 13.3); 世 ('a generation of
#   thirty years', Zhu Xi 三十年為一世, 13.12); 僕 is new (above).
# Not bound, meaning what their parts mean: 衛 | 君, 賢 | 才, 小 | 過, 正 | 名, 禮 | 樂, 刑 | 罰, 手 | 足,
#   老 | 農, 老 | 圃, 用 | 情, 襁 | 負, 專 | 對, 三 | 百, 居 | 室, 期 | 月 (Zhu Xi glosses it as a phrase,
#   周一嵗之月, 'the months of a full round of the year'), 百 | 年, 勝 | 殘, 去 | 殺, 王 | 者, 従 | 政 (as 6.6
#   從 | 政), 何 | 有, 退 | 朝, 而 | 已 (| 矣).
# Collation (Ruan 1816 KR1h0004; He Yan SBCK KR1h0005): noted where sense-bearing — He Yan 奚其正名 (6);
#   He Yan 子曰吾不如老圃 (11); He Yan 亦奚以為哉 (14). Not noted (graphic): 爲 舎 迃 盖 蓋 巳 遅 専 從 鲁 冨 羙
#   丗 錯 (Ruan, for 措) 荊.
